invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_message.c
catches: webpki_session_test
reason: the hello leaves out server_name even when a hostname is set, so a
  server that picks its certificate by name answers with the wrong
  one. Every row that reads the server_name extension objects.

--- old
    if (cfg->hostname_len == 0) {
        return;
    }
    wb_u16(w, EXT_SERVER_NAME);
--- new
    (void)cfg;
    return;
    wb_u16(w, EXT_SERVER_NAME);
